  "description": "Ha-Yun, who was struggling on his own, rescued a Persian cat who got almost hit by a car.\nIt was a good deed without any special intention, but the cat brought along a long-haired woman lying naked in front of his house.\nHa-Yun misunderstood her as a fan and tried to kick her out. However, she insisted that she was the guardian angel and persisted to stay around Ha-Yun.\nShe speaks and acts very differently from ordinary people.\nDue to a weird situation, Ha-Yun is forced to hire her as a manager and live together. Also with blue, the cat that brought her along.\nBut the more he looks at this woman, the more vague it becomes. Is she really... an angel?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
